# Cloudflare Pages redirects for the marketing apexes (form4dev.com, ollastack.com).
#
# Why: the apex domains serve THIS static marketing site. Without this rule,
# /api/* falls through to the marketing 404/index and returns HTML with a 200 —
# which makes integrators (and AI agents) think they found the API when they
# actually hit marketing. The real API lives on login.ollastack.com (and the
# legacy login.form4dev.com); the OpenAPI doc's servers[] block points there.
#
# This 302-redirects any /api/* guess to the canonical API host, preserving the
# path and query string, so `GET ollastack.com/api/openapi.json` auto-discovers.
# Specific rule only — does not touch normal marketing page serving.
/api/*  https://login.ollastack.com/api/:splat  302

